# chorus CEC golden vector: the hub at 1.0.0.0 announces itself: physical address, primary device type 5 (Audio System).
#
# Committed, never written by a test. Rust-only by declaration (CEC runs on the Linux hub
# alone): crates/cec/tests/fixtures.rs decodes these bytes to report_physical_address.fields and encodes the
# fields back to these bytes. Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# header: initiator 5, destination 15
5F

# opcode: report_physical_address
84

# operands
10 00 05
